nts we have to obviously provide  right away for this fire exit from this  other building here and but we do have  the rights over this area we put a  couple of parking spaces and also just  an outside area for the potential  tenants that are going to stay here just  to chill out  end of the guided tour this is  first of the sort of video diary i hope  it's giving you a good idea of the scale  of the project  just really where we're at with it sort  of bringing dave taylor in  maximize what can be done here still a  bit of an unknown definitely i think um  we can definitely make a big improvement  to the existing plans and the layout and  with additional penthouses and  additional  rooms that we're going to create yeah  really really really looking good  obviously there's going to be stumbling  blocks we're going to have hiccups and  hopefully people are going to do this  journey if you're thinking about doing a  commercial development yourself that you  can pick up some good ideas yeah  and yeah we'd be quite happy to  hopefully document as much as we can  yeah moving forward and hopefully not  bore you with too much  and be more upbeat yeah bye cool

